1
00:00:00,043 --> 00:00:02,133
(Prof Crawley:)I discovered it after spending
six months...

2
00:00:02,295 --> 00:00:04,545
(Prof Crawley:)...slogging through
the Bornean rain forests...

3
00:00:05,132 --> 00:00:07,092
(Prof Crawley:)...while my wife was back home...

4
00:00:07,259 --> 00:00:09,589
(Prof Crawley:)...shacking up
with a two-bit ornithologist...

5
00:00:09,761 --> 00:00:14,511
(Prof Crawley:)...who lives on a sailboat
and likes to wear boot-cut jeans.

6
00:00:15,475 --> 00:00:20,145
(Prof Crawley:)So when I tell you
that that's a common field cricket...

7
00:00:20,313 --> 00:00:22,693
(Prof Crawley:)...you can take that
to the damn bank.

8
00:00:22,858 --> 00:00:24,488
Because God knows I can't.

9
00:00:24,651 --> 00:00:27,241
(Prof Crawley:)That tramp took me for everything.

10
00:00:33,243 --> 00:00:35,703
(Sheldon:)Well, apparently I was wrong.

11
00:00:36,621 --> 00:00:38,871
(Sheldon:)Congratulations.

12
00:00:44,087 --> 00:00:45,547
(Raj:)Enjoy Oxnard.

13
00:00:47,507 --> 00:00:57,027
(Raj:)I'm sure your daughter's looking forward
to having you.

